<figcaption>Yardbird</figcaption>
</figure>
<p><a href="https://yardbird.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Yardbird</a> outdoor furniture is the perfect addition to a cozy backyard retreat. It’s also made with recycled ocean plastic, but looks just like natural wicker. The brand keeps a running tally of plastic waste rescued from oceans and offsets 100% of its carbon emissions.</p>
