<p><a href="https://higher-grounds-coffee.myshopify.com/">Higher Grounds Coffee</a> is a <a href="/blog/what-is-b-corporation">certified B Corp</a> company committed to sustainability throughout its supply chain, from partnering with charities to providing living wages through fair trade programs to delivering beans by bike.</p>
<h4 id="23">13. Repurposed vegetable waste</h4>
<figure><img style="display: block; margin: 0 auto;" alt="A bag of Pulp Chips arranged in a picnic spread." src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0070/7032/files/13pulpchips.png?v=1771987805" class="block block--bordered" loading="lazy">
<figcaption>Pulp Pantry</figcaption>
